\newlabel{tab:descriptive_stats}{{1}{35}{Descriptive statistics and stylized-facts tests for SPY daily excess growth rates (in-sample period 2014--2024; $T=2{,}766$ trading days). JB = Jarque-Bera normality test. LB = Ljung-Box autocorrelation test at lag 20. $^\ast $ denotes rejection at $\alpha =0.05$}{table.caption.35}{}}
